theorem whitKer_jac_comap_eq_twKer_derUnip : ∀ (k : Type) [Field k] [ValuativeRel k] [TopologicalSpace k] [IsNonarchimedeanLocalField k] (ψ : AddChar k Circle) (n j : ℕ) (V : Type) [AddCommGroup V] [Module ℂ V]
